{
  "key": "gh-85",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "e2e smoke: document fa session groups in AGENTS.md",
    "description": "Small documentation task for an end-to-end smoke of the full machine cycle.

## Task

Add a short `## Session reuse` section to AGENTS.md describing:
- fa sessions are named per repo:GH-<n>:group; dev/rework share the dev-write conversation, review has dev-review;
- the workflow carries the session directory across CI runs (per-issue git branch fa-sess/gh-<n>);
- the tee (`FA_LOG_FILE`) mirrors the full agent transcript into the run log as `[fa]` lines.

Keep it under 15 lines, follow the existing AGENTS.md tone. This issue also validates the fresh dmtools CLI bundle (v0.1.7) and the agents/ submodule at fc9a570."
  }
}

